* TCYCLE 4 0 1000000 2.5 0: d2 > 0 measures the operation before the loaded one (SimNo-1); dt = (1e6 - (span + 2.5))/4. Step 24 is DSMAX mode (M+0x990 = 0): DTMAX is NOT written to OUT.KEY, OUT.KEY equals kzero (oracle run; see v_t25_*).
DBREAD 24
COG_P1_B1.DB
TCYCLE 4 0 1000000 2.5 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
